	(text "U1903 is powered from always-on 3.3V; output threshold nominal 3.249V.\nCT via 100k to VDD: 180–420ms delay exceeds Sierra 100ms no-drive interval.\nMODEM_RAIL_GOOD drives data isolation and MCU PB13 (pad25). MCU PA0 controls power.\nLow command enables Q1901 discharge; wait at least 1s and bench-verify socket <0.1V\nbefore restart. MCU default/high-Z command is off. Qualify timing per modem profile.\nClear a latched fault only after determining cause; do not create an autonomous reset loop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 508 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "025cd8d5-150e-57c8-85f7-259ae61f83b7")
	)
	(text "Compensated current-mode regulator supports the downstream 220uF modem bulk bank.\nType II: 1k / 100nF, 1nF high-frequency pole. Include eFuse resistance and both banks\nin loop analysis. Verify loop, burst droop, soft-start and thermal behavior on hardware.\n5A is a provisional burst design allocation. The selected 1A/power-contact M.2 socket permits\n5A total at 25C; sharing, hot derating and module envelope require qualification.\nThis is not a guaranteed current envelope for RM551E-GL or Sierra mmWave accessories."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a8c55f9e-69a7-5fe6-966f-a769d019038a")
	)
	(text "Latch-off eFuse: 45mOhm maximum RON. 562R/0.1% gives approx. 5.27–6.45A threshold\nusing the 549R guaranteed table, NOT 5A continuous connector qualification. ITIMER open.\nOVLO: 237k/100k, 3.93–4.18V resistor/reference corners, below modem 4.4V limit.\nPGTH: 165k/100k, nominal 3.18V. Use separate always-on output monitor for USB isolation.\nMaximum continuous device current is 5.5A; connector/profile hot limits can be lower.\nNo UL assembly claim: this threshold does not meet the datasheet RILM>=750R recognition condition."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 591.82 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ce479527-5a60-5289-99d1-9cc4bd12d00a")
	)
